{"schema_version":1,"batch_id":"screening-0099","screening_model":"gpt-5.6-luna","reasoning":"medium","prompt_version":"gauss-screening-v1","item_count":6,"subject":"math","topic_key":"statistics","total_weight":111,"expected_output":"screening-0099.output.jsonl","items":[{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_2026","source_sha256":"bbd7864bbe0533d37fb50bf012b28089e22821e7aa30a4580adc30a1d07054a1","subject":"math","section_id":"math_discrete_data","source_topic_key":"statistics","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"در تعدادی دادهٔ آماری به هر داده ۴ برابر میانگین داده‌ها را اضافه می‌کنیم. ضریب تغییرات جدید چند برابر ضریب تغییرات اولیه است؟"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2026/stem_1.webp","alt":"متن سوال ۲۰۲۶","aspect_ratio":13.9545}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$1$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2026/option_1_2.webp","alt":"گزینه ۱","aspect_ratio":2.0185}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\dfrac{1}{4}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2026/option_2_3.webp","alt":"گزینه ۲","aspect_ratio":2.1111}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\dfrac{1}{5}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2026/option_3_4.webp","alt":"گزینه ۳","aspect_ratio":2.1111}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\dfrac{4}{5}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2026/option_4_5.webp","alt":"گزینه ۴","aspect_ratio":2.2037}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"اگر به همه داده‌ها $4\\overline{x}$ اضافه شود، به میانگین داده‌ها $4\\overline{x}$ اضافه شده و انحراف معیار تغییر نمی‌کند.\n$\\text{CV} = \\frac{\\sigma}{\\overline{x}}$\n$\\text{CV}_{\\text{جدید}} = \\frac{\\sigma}{\\overline{x}+4\\overline{x}} = \\frac{\\sigma}{5\\overline{x}} = \\frac{1}{5}\\text{CV}$"}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2026/option_1_2.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2026/option_2_3.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2026/option_3_4.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2026/option_4_5.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2026/stem_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2026/option_1_2.webp","sha256":"06754d3534c7eeed8adfd073fa095874fc6a44c8b68690a9bb8efcf704bb4ed1","bytes":1882},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2026/option_2_3.webp","sha256":"c30d688e8931c2cca3786a5284dfc5817b713d11e96f22231a07938d24a07820","bytes":2044},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2026/option_3_4.webp","sha256":"e7ae29ad90795ce88e233b5467166dc648f82f432adba8d94d5d840d8ce3b9f0","bytes":2194},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2026/option_4_5.webp","sha256":"6f03d3730172bcaea887da5ec174f254541f6f2b040e5180c37c0b7f1d4bdd3a","bytes":1362},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2026/stem_1.webp","sha256":"cb27822018d44f93a5a1cbfa6763d47b8c7c3b9c9d035cda14ac3a73b5d33616","bytes":2022}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":2026,"question_pdf":"18.pdf","question_page":6,"solution_page":188,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_2027","source_sha256":"4333edf4ff43839a0ea458c64e32ffa6ed0a611a7f8c19282e2e084277670972","subject":"math","section_id":"math_discrete_data","source_topic_key":"statistics","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"در ۸ دادهٔ آماری میانگین و واریانس داده‌های کم‌تر از میانه ۲ و $\\dfrac{1}{2}$ و میانگین و ضریب تغییرات داده‌های بیشتر از میانه ۶ و صفر است. واریانس تمام داده‌ها چه عددی است؟"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2027/stem_1.webp","alt":"متن سوال ۲۰۲۷","aspect_ratio":11.3704}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$4$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2027/option_1_2.webp","alt":"گزینه ۱","aspect_ratio":2.4773}],[{"type":"text","text":"$4/15$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2027/option_2_3.webp","alt":"گزینه ۲","aspect_ratio":2.5909}],[{"type":"text","text":"$4/2$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2027/option_3_4.webp","alt":"گزینه ۳","aspect_ratio":2.5909}],[{"type":"text","text":"$4/25$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2027/option_4_5.webp","alt":"گزینه ۴","aspect_ratio":2.7045}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"میانگین ۴ دادهٔ اول برابر ۲ و میانگین ۴ دادهٔ بعدی برابر ۶ است. بنابراین میانگین کل داده‌ها برابر $\\frac{2+6}{2}=4$ است.\nواریانس ۴ دادهٔ اول برابر $\\frac{1}{2}$ است:\n$$ \\sigma_1^2 = \\frac{\\sum x_i^2}{n} - (\\overline{x}_1)^2 = \\frac{\\sum_{i=1}^4 x_i^2}{4} - 2^2 = \\frac{1}{2} \\Rightarrow \\sum_{i=1}^4 x_i^2 = 18 $$\nواریانس ۴ دادهٔ دوم برابر صفر و میانگین برابر ۶ است، در نتیجه هر ۴ داده برابر ۶ هستند. خواهیم داشت:\n$$ \\sigma^2 = \\frac{\\sum_{i=1}^8 x_i^2}{n} - (\\overline{x})^2 = \\frac{\\sum_{i=1}^4 x_i^2 + \\sum_{i=5}^8 x_i^2}{8} - 4^2 = \\frac{18 + 4(6)^2}{8} - 16 = \\frac{162}{8} - 16 = 4/25 $$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2027/solution_6.webp","alt":"حل سوال ۲۰۲۷","aspect_ratio":0.4257}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2027/option_1_2.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2027/option_2_3.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2027/option_3_4.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2027/option_4_5.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2027/solution_6.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2027/stem_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2027/option_1_2.webp","sha256":"9b0285e61197deb8d678c93a90a85b1aad228404a3bd0f84327a20ca41e522ff","bytes":2058},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2027/option_2_3.webp","sha256":"f3f510b71c2eddbaef1b80185c41b7d535771015c5602e09fac70da612888344","bytes":2384},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2027/option_3_4.webp","sha256":"b939714e12054b84063b2045ef9eb01e40f7726c2684dbe00aa9b384ec3a3c17","bytes":2524},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2027/option_4_5.webp","sha256":"83f9786da9851077d0b5734e81dc5e029731cc86b2b2b43d1bc7a973f28c21e2","bytes":2040},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2027/solution_6.webp","sha256":"7851c941a9255fef74a269b75627c83681d1fe4d1708e23643cec02ed9f85b97","bytes":47292},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2027/stem_1.webp","sha256":"3ce6ccb617b99f66834fe535a74d26b32242e62685e2ce8651186b79e26ebbb1","bytes":7856}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":2027,"question_pdf":"18.pdf","question_page":6,"solution_page":188,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_2028","source_sha256":"e014cfbf4d297c2139bdcfa821f6227f13cd0e51bfe43243b8d04dead0107a3d","subject":"math","section_id":"math_discrete_data","source_topic_key":"statistics","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"اگر هر یک از داده‌های آماری را ۴ برابر کرده و از هر یک ۲ واحد کم کنیم، ضریب تغییرات جدید ۲۵ درصد افزایش می‌یابد. میانگین داده‌های اول چه عددی است؟"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2028/stem_1.webp","alt":"متن سوال ۲۰۲۸","aspect_ratio":11.3704}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$\\dfrac{9}{4}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2028/option_1_2.webp","alt":"گزینه ۱","aspect_ratio":2.0185}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\dfrac{5}{2}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2028/option_2_3.webp","alt":"گزینه ۲","aspect_ratio":2.1111}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\dfrac{11}{4}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2028/option_3_4.webp","alt":"گزینه ۳","aspect_ratio":2.1111}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\dfrac{7}{2}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2028/option_4_5.webp","alt":"گزینه ۴","aspect_ratio":2.2037}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"وقتی داده‌ها را $4$ برابر کرده و از هر یک $2$ واحد کم می‌کنیم، میانگین نیز $4$ برابر شده و سپس $2$ واحد کاهش می‌یابد، ولی انحراف معیار فقط $4$ برابر می‌شود.\n$\\text{CV}_{\\text{جدید}} = 1/25\\text{CV} \\Rightarrow \\frac{\\cancel{4}\\sigma}{4\\overline{x}-2} = 1/25 \\frac{\\cancel{\\sigma}}{\\overline{x}}$\n$\\Rightarrow 4\\overline{x} = 1/25(4\\overline{x}-2) \\Rightarrow 4\\overline{x} = 5\\overline{x}-2/5$\n$\\Rightarrow \\overline{x} = 2/5 = \\frac{5}{2}$"}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2028/option_1_2.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2028/option_2_3.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2028/option_3_4.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2028/option_4_5.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2028/stem_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2028/option_1_2.webp","sha256":"a44e62bc23cf02138ee012e9f8d4da9d852822703a8ac4be33958561cdd5ec71","bytes":3272},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2028/option_2_3.webp","sha256":"6364e678b1d4bda59681da3b5df8d86a8ff67c209eab87644bc3c06e740448d2","bytes":2248},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2028/option_3_4.webp","sha256":"85b58910e3c131f4b78110e1651a280a65ed3c15832caf1f74c4ec8036b59e0f","bytes":2176},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2028/option_4_5.webp","sha256":"fea005b242399021f8c89423f39802eb3e864dcfc03d41ca604a17327494d40f","bytes":2218},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2028/stem_1.webp","sha256":"b86b3a253461f4d876885273f241d48475d12dbcd58518599512d422de867665","bytes":8372}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":2028,"question_pdf":"18.pdf","question_page":6,"solution_page":188,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_2029","source_sha256":"623fc4c76dfe0d59cf3235aa680207ded29322da7ee7c95bae7c063d089aae96","subject":"math","section_id":"math_discrete_data","source_topic_key":"statistics","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"میانگین ۷ دادهٔ آماری ۴ و واریانس آن‌ها ۲ است. هرگاه داده‌های $2, a, 3$ را از بین داده‌ها حذف کنیم میانگین داده‌ها تغییر نمی‌کند. واریانس چه‌قدر کاهش می‌یابد؟"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2029/stem_1.webp","alt":"متن سوال ۲۰۲۹","aspect_ratio":12.5306}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$1$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2029/option_1_2.webp","alt":"گزینه ۱","aspect_ratio":2.0185}],[{"type":"text","text":"$2$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2029/option_2_3.webp","alt":"گزینه ۲","aspect_ratio":2.1111}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\dfrac{3}{4}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2029/option_3_4.webp","alt":"گزینه ۳","aspect_ratio":2.1111}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\dfrac{4}{3}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2029/option_4_5.webp","alt":"گزینه ۴","aspect_ratio":2.2037}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"با حذف داده‌های ۳، $a$ و ۲ میانگین داده‌ها تغییر نکرده است. بنابراین میانگین اعداد حذف‌شده با میانگین اولیه برابر بوده است:\n$$ \\frac{2+a+3}{3} = 4 \\Rightarrow a=7 $$\nواریانس داده‌های اولیه ۲ بوده است:\n$$ \\sigma^2 = \\frac{(x_1-4)^2 + (x_2-4)^2 + (x_3-4)^2 + (x_4-4)^2}{7} + \\frac{(2-4)^2 + (7-4)^2 + (3-4)^2}{7} = 2 $$\n$$ \\Rightarrow \\frac{(x_1-4)^2 + \\cdots + (x_4-4)^2 + 14}{7} = 2 $$\n$$ \\Rightarrow (x_1-4)^2 + \\cdots + (x_4-4)^2 = 0 $$\n$$ \\Rightarrow x_1 = x_2 = x_3 = x_4 = 4 $$\nداده‌های باقی‌مانده با هم برابر بوده و واریانس آن‌ها صفر است. $2 - 0 = 2$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2029/solution_6.webp","alt":"حل سوال ۲۰۲۹","aspect_ratio":0.1365},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2029/solution_continuation_7.webp","alt":"ادامه حل سوال ۲۰۲۹","aspect_ratio":0.28}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2029/option_1_2.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2029/option_2_3.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2029/option_3_4.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2029/option_4_5.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2029/solution_6.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2029/solution_continuation_7.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2029/stem_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2029/option_1_2.webp","sha256":"aeffe8b445a6c9ef9b78c0423310e15e0bafeee669c5f01befc85055d769c94c","bytes":2328},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2029/option_2_3.webp","sha256":"77fb1378350da32de50189dc498f563b5d518e3c01c850e3fb2a32f5e9dd8f1d","bytes":1972},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2029/option_3_4.webp","sha256":"cdf0d68efecc3bd076232b181d2ee02be12f8bd37b5e603d4cf21cd6f82af228","bytes":2262},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2029/option_4_5.webp","sha256":"3ed0a272e4e03f2b44b2debc42b72ad1369d62c7cf742f772493e93a4f47475e","bytes":2230},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2029/solution_6.webp","sha256":"7092583921046e3049160de446a846f034e8f0d098da4b8a002103e9aa8850ca","bytes":15554},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2029/solution_continuation_7.webp","sha256":"e96afee16981d8cdd45b3d7a95a233d1416aa616ee18df26fa84f6af46b617bd","bytes":33508},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2029/stem_1.webp","sha256":"2f1b54c443693a2a530ed1a130c63232d650d30b464144dcf9b7798c537e0b53","bytes":3386}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":2029,"question_pdf":"18.pdf","question_page":6,"solution_page":188,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_2030","source_sha256":"f6701921acaab91f6a940e964032a44da5c4e7c833ffa191fe2ed5e40399add5","subject":"math","section_id":"math_discrete_data","source_topic_key":"statistics","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"داده‌های $10, 13, 14, 15, 15, 17$ را در نظر بگیرید. اگر داده‌ای که با میانگین برابر است را حذف کنیم، واریانس داده‌های جدید چند برابر واریانس داده‌های اولیه است؟"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2030/stem_1.webp","alt":"متن سوال ۲۰۳۰","aspect_ratio":12.5306}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$\\dfrac{7}{6}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2030/option_1_2.webp","alt":"گزینه ۱","aspect_ratio":2.0185}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\dfrac{5}{6}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2030/option_2_3.webp","alt":"گزینه ۲","aspect_ratio":2.1111}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\dfrac{6}{5}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2030/option_3_4.webp","alt":"گزینه ۳","aspect_ratio":2.1111}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\dfrac{6}{7}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2030/option_4_5.webp","alt":"گزینه ۴","aspect_ratio":2.2037}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"واریانس ۶ داده ابتدایی را محاسبه می‌کنیم.\n$$ \\overline{x} = \\frac{10+13+14+15+15+17}{6} = 14 $$\n$$ \\sigma^2 = \\frac{(10-14)^2+(13-14)^2+(14-14)^2}{6} + \\frac{(15-14)^2+(15-14)^2+(17-14)^2}{6} = \\frac{28}{6} $$\nعدد حذف شده برابر میانگین است. بنابراین میانگین ۵ داده باقی‌مانده تغییر نکرده و برابر ۱۴ است. واریانس این داده‌ها برابر است با:\n$$ \\sigma_{\\text{جدید}}^2 = \\frac{28}{5} $$\nدر نتیجه:\n$$ \\frac{\\sigma_{\\text{جدید}}^2}{\\sigma_{\\text{اولیه}}^2} = \\frac{\\frac{28}{5}}{\\frac{28}{6}} = \\frac{6}{5} $$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2030/solution_6.webp","alt":"حل سوال ۲۰۳۰","aspect_ratio":0.3207}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2030/option_1_2.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2030/option_2_3.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2030/option_3_4.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2030/option_4_5.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2030/solution_6.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2030/stem_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2030/option_1_2.webp","sha256":"df7879f3abccbdffe28a58dada38b7f131f7665402f4520aa915bdad4f9278e3","bytes":2076},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2030/option_2_3.webp","sha256":"5a4e87c0c73e8b8fffd4c1b61bdcbac70de46473b288c4f9f041a4af6efc1514","bytes":2514},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2030/option_3_4.webp","sha256":"e34fddf11e2834846c3aff6488a0ffff2d9427a852c3f7628175b44be3e97004","bytes":2626},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2030/option_4_5.webp","sha256":"ba377e578049ed556890b211406ab62d0fb33fc0f1edadcc04c550a77a4b2c05","bytes":2132},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2030/solution_6.webp","sha256":"d1bbc76382379e3699d4934f7e188e8f95728945105b633a6501e445c18b7510","bytes":23796},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2030/stem_1.webp","sha256":"ba4e39d7caf305fbdd876df088cbfd117e577347d45d759752f322d1773042d9","bytes":2034}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":2030,"question_pdf":"18.pdf","question_page":6,"solution_page":189,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_2031","source_sha256":"e412efdfe35a5a32858a3666ee62a51e4d60c0092b7775689740693a3d576f6d","subject":"math","section_id":"math_discrete_data","source_topic_key":"statistics","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"میانگین اعداد $a, b, c, d, e$ برابر $d$ است. اگر $d$ را از بین آن‌ها حذف کنیم، ضریب تغییرات ۴ دادهٔ جدید چند برابر ضریب تغییرات اولیه است؟"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2031/stem_1.webp","alt":"متن سوال ۲۰۳۱","aspect_ratio":13.9545}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$\\dfrac{4}{5}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2031/option_1_2.webp","alt":"گزینه ۱","aspect_ratio":2.0185}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\dfrac{5}{4}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2031/option_2_3.webp","alt":"گزینه ۲","aspect_ratio":2.1111}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\dfrac{\\sqrt{5}}{2}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2031/option_3_4.webp","alt":"گزینه ۳","aspect_ratio":2.1111}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\dfrac{2}{\\sqrt{5}}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2031/option_4_5.webp","alt":"گزینه ۴","aspect_ratio":2.2037}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"عدد حذف شده برابر میانگین است؛ بنابراین میانگین دو گروه برابر است.\n$$ \\sigma_{\\text{اولیه}}^2 = \\frac{(a-d)^2+(b-d)^2+(c-d)^2+(d-d)^2+(e-d)^2}{5} $$\n$$ = \\frac{k}{5} \\Rightarrow \\sigma_{\\text{اولیه}} = \\sqrt{\\frac{k}{5}} $$\n$$ \\sigma_{\\text{جدید}}^2 = \\frac{(a-d)^2+(b-d)^2+(c-d)^2+(e-d)^2}{4} = \\frac{k}{4} $$\n$$ \\Rightarrow \\sigma_{\\text{جدید}} = \\sqrt{\\frac{k}{4}} $$\nواضح است صورت هر دو کسر برابر است. بنابراین:\n$$ \\frac{CV_{\\text{جدید}}}{CV_{\\text{اولیه}}} = \\frac{\\frac{\\sigma_{\\text{جدید}}}{\\overline{x}}}{\\frac{\\sigma_{\\text{اولیه}}}{\\overline{x}}} = \\frac{\\sigma_{\\text{جدید}}}{\\sigma_{\\text{اولیه}}} = \\frac{\\sqrt{\\frac{k}{4}}}{\\sqrt{\\frac{k}{5}}} = \\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{2} $$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2031/solution_6.webp","alt":"حل سوال ۲۰۳۱","aspect_ratio":0.3788}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2031/option_1_2.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2031/option_2_3.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2031/option_3_4.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2031/option_4_5.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2031/solution_6.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2031/stem_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2031/option_1_2.webp","sha256":"eaa7d310d571fa0de47ae89a2a5847a4822aad74115b4eb35e36c1a2b748b367","bytes":2182},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2031/option_2_3.webp","sha256":"7d786101a4a9677dbc827831480315b7e8fcc54248964c964140a8b117b566d6","bytes":2078},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2031/option_3_4.webp","sha256":"ff8ef1b26864c4ee36fa536ff51b730b30873c75730cee0540cd92e022423f90","bytes":1696},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2031/option_4_5.webp","sha256":"69da007f1127b3aa772cc577ab5f2590ed1bee77ba5832babdae14f9aaa2eaaf","bytes":1062},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2031/solution_6.webp","sha256":"95513d55f3ffb9393e111874c681838a37d891895ee38d1bcf22eee3c01121f7","bytes":41858},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_2031/stem_1.webp","sha256":"76fcb15fb2ddcdf9a34ac2f9c879c18cddb1ddb19f090bfbeb7f44c09dd95aab","bytes":10626}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":2031,"question_pdf":"18.pdf","question_page":6,"solution_page":189,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true}]}
